Date: Sun, 13 Sep 2026 09:39:15 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix: tighten receipt/invoice/proforma template spacing so
 more documents fit naturally on fewer pages

Real gap addressed: font sizes in this template were already
appropriately small (7-22px range, mostly 8-13px for body text) - the
actual cumulative height problem was the whitespace BETWEEN
sections. Summed across a typical document (header, the two-column
info grid, vehicle details box, totals block, items table,
confirmation box, terms) the margins alone added up to roughly
100px+ of pure spacing.

Tightened every section's margin-bottom and internal padding
moderately (roughly 30% reduction throughout) without touching a
single font-size - reclaims meaningful vertical space while keeping
every line exactly as readable as before.
---
 components/shared/DocumentViewer.tsx | 44 ++++++++++++++--------------
 1 file changed, 22 insertions(+), 22 deletions(-)

